  "text": "<strong>Given caught behind! Australia jubilant</strong>. Stokes isn't sure he's hit it. He checks with Root and decides to review. Fuller length but not a half volley, he tries to drive on the up against the angle and seems to get a little scratch through to Carey. Ultraedge shows a bit spike! England lose the review and their captain.",
  "postText": "<strong>Drinks</strong> The game has changed in an instance. Suddenly some pressure on England. Great spell from Hazlewood.\n\nTJ: \"A lot of people were baffled that Hazlewood was in contention for selection. No longer the case I hope.\"",
